// A visitor kind's body may hold objects, as any kind's may. The first
// time a person arrives they are made as a spawn is, with their own copy
// of each, so everyone comes into the yard carrying a satchel of their
// own; a returning visitor comes back with what they carried away, and is
// never given those contents again. `transcripts/satchel.txt` plays it.
world visitor_contents is sprout.World {
  visitors are Visitor
  visitors arrive at yard

  object yard is sprout.Place { }
}
